<title>USA: Continucare Corp Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Continucare Corp Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONTINUCARE CORPORATION</p>
<p>			  CONSOLIDATED STATEMENT OF INCOME</p>
<p>				   Three Mos (a)	   Nine Mos (a)</p>
<p>				   Ended Mar 31,	  Ended Mar 31,</p>
<p>					     1997		     1997</p>
<p> Revenues			   $3,597,241	     $9,604,216</p>
<p> Income from operations	    700,071		2,738,270</p>
<p> Net income			    497,752		1,681,133</p>
<p> Earnings per share		     0.04		     0.16</p>
<p>Fully diluted weighted</p>
<p>average number of shares</p>
<p>  outstanding		     12,149,904	     10,742,435</p>
<p>(a) Pre-Merger Continucare commenced operations on February 12, 1996. Accordingly, no comparative data is available for the three and nine month periods ended March 31, 1996. SOURCE  Continucare Corporation</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
